#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid ""
"Masterclass 22.01: Funnel Metadynamics (FM): predicting ligand binding "
"models, binding free energies and kinetics"
msgstr ""
"Masterclass 22.01：Funnel Metadynamics (FM)：Ligand 結合モデル・自由エネルギー・Kinetics の予測"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"This lesson was given as part of the PLUMED masterclass series in 2022. It "
"included:"
msgstr "2022年 PLUMED Masterclass シリーズの Lesson で、次を含みます。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid ""
"A two video set covering the theory behind the technique and practical "
"information to set up and analyse the results."
msgstr "理論と、設定・解析の実践を扱う2本の動画。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:6
msgid "A set of inputs to try the code and rerun FM on a paradigmatic system."
msgstr "代表系で FM を再実行する入力。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:7
msgid ""
"Some supplementary python notebooks that provide further background "
"information on the exercise."
msgstr "演習の背景知識を補う Python Notebooks。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:9
msgid ""
"The flow chart shown below indicates the order in which you should consult "
"the resources. You can click on the nodes to access the various resources. "
"Follow the thick black lines for the best results. The resources that are "
"connected by dashed lines are supplmentary resources that you may find "
"useful when completing the exercise."
msgstr ""
"下のフローチャートは資料を参照する順序を示している。各ノードをクリックすると資料を開ける。太い黒線に沿って進めることを推奨する。破線でつながる資料は、演習に取り組む際に役立つ補足資料である。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:11
msgid "This data was presented among the masterclasses in the 2022 series."
msgstr "2022年 Masterclass シリーズで紹介したデータ。"

